  "description": "Nam Yu-Won, known by many titles, including “the No. 1 male member of Ombreez Poca” and “official center”, has been struggling with something lately. Choi Si-Heon, a member who’s been his rival since their trainee days, has been acting strange. Not that he wasn’t always a bit of an oddball, though. Then, through a suspicious diary he received from a fan, Yu-Won discovers Si-Heon’s true feelings...\n\n*“Ah, Nam Yu-Won is so damn cute. I want to date him.”*\n\nHow am I supposed to focus on the stage after hearing something like that?!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
